            <ArticleTitle>Multivessel coronary angioplasty.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>675-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Multivessel coronary angioplasty is currently a revascularization alternative in selected patients with suitable anatomy. The literature on two- and three-vessel coronary angioplasty is reviewed with respect to both immediate success and long-term outcome. A therapeutic strategy for performing multivessel coronary angioplasty in the individual patient is outlined.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
